{
  "title": "Oven-Peppered Egyptian Pork Stew",
  "description": "A dense, peppery pork stew infused with dried oregano and rendered lardons, finished in a bamboo steamer for a moist, flavorful keto-friendly meal.",
  "cuisine": "Egyptian",
