  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 200°C.",
    "Toss pork cubes with smoked paprika, black pepper, dried oregano, and a pinch of salt.",
    "Heat a skillet and render the lardons until crisp, then set aside.",
    "Sear the seasoned pork in the same skillet until browned on all sides.",
    "Add minced garlic and diced onion to the skillet and cook until softened.",
    "Stir in tomato paste and fresh thyme, coating the pork well.",
    "Pour in the low-carb chicken broth and bring to a gentle simmer.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a bamboo steamer basket and steam covered for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the steamer, stir in the rendered lardons, and serve hot.",
    "Garnish with a sprinkle of fresh thyme if desired."
  ],
